This directory contains a vendored copy of emqx/grpc-erl.

  Upstream: https://github.com/emqx/grpc-erl
  Commit:   acaa5321bd3994ae51d6457c351552c30f6c6173
  License:  Apache License 2.0, see LICENSE in this directory
  Changes:  none to the Erlang sources. The generated protocol modules in
            src/ (grpc_*_pb.erl, *_client.erl and *_bhvr.erl) were produced by
            upstream's own build from priv/*.proto and are committed here,
            because a dependency's project plugins do not run. Two local
            changes: rebar.config declares no dependencies, because this app is
            built as a member of this repository and an umbrella merges a
            project app's deps into the root graph; and src/grpc.app.src names
            {vsn, "0.8.2"}, upstream's tag for this commit, because a fetched
            copy took its version from git and a vendored one has no .git, so
            rebar3 fell back to 0.0.0 and the release would have shipped grpc
            as 0.0.0. rebar.config is
            this repository's own, so the app resolves against registry
            releases.

The in-tree copy exists so the gRPC runtime the gateway serves with is a commit
of this repository rather than a moving upstream branch (reckon-gateway#5).
